2. Initiate a SET operation on all those parameters with the same value retrieved using the previous GET operation and with the parameter''s datatype.
3. The parameter will be write-access compliant if the SET operation does not fail with read-only error code.
4. Return success if all applicable parameters are write-access compliant. Else, return failure and publish the failed parameters list.', 'Writable parameters in HARVESTER module should not throw error code when a SET operation is attempted on it.', '0ee989a8-f1c0-4cf9-918b-0b7eb0eff21e', '2026-03-19 06:39:34.803632', '2026-03-19 06:39:34.803634');
