2. Proceed to an add table row operation for all those identified table objects using WebPA protocol.
3. Check if the add table row operation fails with the expected error code for Static Tables.
4. Return success if rows do not get added to the applicable Static Tables. Else, return failure and publish the failed tables.', 'Adding rows to static table objects under WANMANAGER module using WebPA protocol should return the expected error code.', 'cd1eefa8-e7e4-42ae-84d4-15568fa859fa', '2026-03-19 06:39:39.410645', '2026-03-19 06:39:39.410646');
