4. Check if the delete table row operation fails with the expected error code for Static Tables.
5. Return success if rows do not get deleted from the applicable Static Tables. Else, return failure and publish the failed tables.', 'Deleting rows from static table objects under WANMANAGER module using WebPA protocol should return the expected errorcode.', '0e4c8c14-780c-4900-b87f-be8e8c4819cc', '2026-03-19 06:39:41.185591', '2026-03-19 06:39:41.185593');
