4. Return success if all applicable parameters are write-access compliant. Else, return failure and publish the failed parameters list.', 'Writable parameters in Misc module should not throw read-only error code when a SET operation is attempted on it using WebPA protocol.', 'e70e4acf-035e-448e-a149-ebf71098b4d9', '2026-03-19 06:39:36.289908', '2026-03-19 06:39:36.289909');
DELETE FROM test_step WHERE script_id = '71af305f-b267-4285-8dee-9e4fdc817fff';
INSERT INTO test_step (id, step_name, step_description, expected_result, script_id, created_date, updated_at) VALUES ('824a823b-cdc0-4fbb-8e92-0895c2dd687d', 'STEP 1', '1. For all parameters under the MeshAgent module which are applicable for the device platform under test, perform a GET operation.
2. Initiate a SET operation on all those parameters with the same value retrieved using the previous GET operation but with an incorrect datatype.
3. The parameter will be write-type compliant if the SET operations fail with the expected error code.
4. Return success if all applicable parameters are write-type compliant. Else, return failure and publish the failed parameters list.', 'Writable parameters in MeshAgent module should throw the expected error code when a SET operation is attempted on it with an invalid parameter type.', '71af305f-b267-4285-8dee-9e4fdc817fff', '2026-03-19 06:39:37.130607', '2026-03-19 06:39:37.130608');
