2. For all such parameters, perform a SET operation with a new value in line with the parameters''s datatype.
3. Check if the SET operation returns a FAILURE with the expected error code.
4. Return success if all read-only parameters fail with the expected return code. Else, return failure and publish the failed parameters list.', 'Setting the "read-only" TR-181 DML parameters under the WIFI module should return error code.', 'b246a4f5-71aa-4c83-bba0-d7794ac62cb1', '2026-03-19 06:39:34.565039', '2026-03-19 06:39:34.565040');
